#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:4
msgid "Managing Palettes and Styles"
msgstr "管理调色板和样式"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:5
msgid ""
"In OpenToonz, Toonz Vector and Toonz Raster animation levels comes with their "
"own palette, containing styles that can be used to *draw lines* and *paint "
"lines and areas*. Raster levels, on the contrary, can be just edited by using "
"the styles available in the **Raster Drawing Palette**, that is shared by all "
"of the raster levels in the project."
msgstr ""
"在OpenToonz中，Toonz矢量和Toonz光栅动画级别都有自己的调色板，其中包含可用于*绘制"
"线条*和*绘制线条和区域*的样式。相反，光栅级别可以通过使用**光栅绘图调色板**中可"
"用的样式进行编辑，该调色板由项目中的所有光栅级别共享。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:7
msgid ""
"In Toonz Vector and Toonz Raster levels, palette styles are interactively "
"“linked” to drawn *lines* and filled *areas* by using indexes. The main "
"advantage of this method is that if you edit a style of the palette, all the "
"lines and filled areas using that style will be automatically updated. This "
"allows you to change or calibrate colors, even after the painting process has "
"been done, without having to correct the style line by line, or area by area in "
"the image."
msgstr ""
"在Toonz Vector和Toonz Raster级别中，调色板样式通过使用索引交互式地“链接”到绘制的"
"*线条*和填充的*区域*。这种方法的主要优点是，如果编辑调色板的样式，则使用该样式的"
"所有线条和填充区域都将自动更新。这允许您更改或校准颜色，即使在绘制过程完成后，也"
"不必逐行或逐区域校正图像中的样式。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:9
msgid ""
"In Raster levels, palette styles are simply used to draw or touch up the image, "
"and no link exists between the styles and the already drawn lines. This "
"palette, named **Raster Drawing Palette**, is shared by all the Raster levels "
"belonging to a specific project and is stored in the **+palettes**  project "
"default folder (see  :ref:`Project Default Folders "
"<project_default_folders>`  )."
msgstr ""
"在光栅级别中，调色板样式仅用于绘制或润色图像，样式与已绘制的线条之间不存在任何链"
"接。此调色板名为**光栅绘图调色板**，由属于特定项目的所有光栅级别共享，并存储在"
"***+调色板**项目默认文件夹中（请参阅：ref:`项目默认文件夹"
"<project_default_Folders>`）。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:11
msgid ""
"All the editing performed in palettes and styles is not saved until you save "
"the related Toonz level, the palette itself, or the **Save All** command is "
"used (see  :ref:`Saving Levels <saving_levels>`  )."
msgstr ""
"在保存相关的Toanz级别、调色板本身或使用**全部保存**命令之前，调色板和样式中执行"
"的所有编辑都不会保存（请参阅：ref:`保存级别<saveing_Levels>`）。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:17
msgid "The Palette Editor"
msgstr "调色板编辑器"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:19
msgid ""
"The Palette Editor displays the styles of the current animation level that are "
"(or can be) used, to draw and paint the level."
msgstr ""
"调色板编辑器显示当前动画级别的样式，这些样式用于（或可以用于）绘制和绘制级别。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:21
msgid "|palette|"
msgstr "|调色板|"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:23
msgid ""
"The default palette of any new **Toonz Vector** level contains only the plain "
"black color; the default palette of a **Toonz Raster** level contains either "
"the plain black color, for new levels, or the colors recognized during the "
"cleanup process, for cleaned up levels from scans. Any palette always contains "
"the **Color_0** item, that allows you to remove any style from *lines* and "
"filled *areas*."
msgstr ""
"任何新**Toanz Vector**级别的默认调色板仅包含纯黑色；**Toanz Raster**级别的默认调"
"色板包含纯黑色，用于新级别，或在清理过程中识别的颜色，用于扫描中清理的级别。任何"
"调色板都始终包含**Color_0**项，这允许您从*行*和填充的*区域*中删除任何样式。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:25
msgid "Each palette can contain up to 4096 styles."
msgstr "每个调色板最多可包含4096种样式。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:27
msgid "Styles in the Palette Editor can be displayed in different modes:"
msgstr "调色板编辑器中的样式可以以不同的模式显示："

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Small Thumbnails View** displays styles as small squares. The style index is "
"displayed at the bottom right corner. Full name of the style can be displayed "
"as a tooltip."
msgstr ""
"**小缩略图视图**将样式显示为小方块。样式索引显示在右下角。样式的全名可以显示为工"
"具提示。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Medium Thumbnails View** displays styles as medium squares. You can read the "
"first letters of the name of the style directly inside the chips; the style "
"index is displayed at the bottom right corner. Full name of the style can be "
"displayed as a tooltip."
msgstr ""
"**中等缩略图视图**将样式显示为中等正方形。您可以直接在芯片内读取样式名称的首字"
"母；样式索引显示在右下角。样式的全名可以显示为工具提示。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Large Thumbnails View** displays styles as large squares. You can read the "
"first letters of the name of the style directly inside the chips; the style "
"index is displayed at the bottom right corner. Full name of the style can be "
"displayed as a tooltip."
msgstr ""
"**大缩略图视图**将样式显示为大正方形。您可以直接在芯片内读取样式名称的首字母；样"
"式索引显示在右下角。样式的全名可以显示为工具提示。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:35
msgid ""
"**List View** displays style thumbnails next to their names in a list; the "
"index of the style is displayed as a tooltip. If the palette styles refer to a "
"studio palette, its path will be displayed along with the style name (see  :ref:"
"`Using the Studio Palette <using_the_studio_palette>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**列表视图**在列表中的名称旁边显示样式缩略图；样式的索引显示为工具提示。如果调色"
"板样式引用工作室调色板，则其路径将与样式名称一起显示（请参阅：ref:`使用工作室调"
"色板<Using_the_strudio_palette>`）。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:37
msgid ""
"By default the Palette editor is *active*, that means that it automatically "
"displays the styles of the current animation level, but it can be made "
"*inactive* in order not to be updated when you select a different level. In "
"this way, by opening more than one Palette editor it will be possible to "
"simultaneously compare and edit several palettes referring to different "
"animation levels."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，调色板编辑器是*活动*的，这意味着它会自动显示当前动画级别的样式，但也"
"可以将其设置为*非活动*，以便在选择其他级别时不会更新。这样，通过打开多个调色板编"
"辑器，可以同时比较和编辑涉及不同动画级别的多个调色板。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:39
msgid ""
"Palettes also can be saved as independent files in TPL format to be loaded back "
"into the scene to retrieve colors, or to be used with the **External Palette** "
"effect (see  :ref:`Using the File Browser <using_the_file_browser>`  and  :ref:"
"`External Palette <external_palette>`  )."
msgstr ""
"调色板也可以保存为TPL格式的独立文件，以加载回场景中检索颜色，或与**外部调色板**"
"效果一起使用（请参阅：ref:“使用文件浏览器<Using_the_File_Browser>”和：ref:`外部"
"调色板<External_plete>”）。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:41
msgid ""
"Most of the palette editing described below can be applied to the **Palette** "
"viewer available in the **Studio Palette** as well (see  :ref:`Using the Studio "
"Palette <using_the_studio_palette>`  )."
msgstr ""
"下面描述的大多数调色板编辑也可以应用于**Studio palette**中可用的**palette**查看"
"器（请参阅：ref:`使用Studio palette<Using_the_Studio_palette>`）。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:43
msgid "**To change the palette display mode:**"
msgstr "**要更改调色板显示模式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:45
#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:75
#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:87
#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:141
#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:214
#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:250
#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:274
#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:375
#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:417
#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:795
#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:805
#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:815
#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:825
msgid "Do one of the following:"
msgstr "执行以下操作之一："

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:47
msgid ""
"Click the option button (|option|) on the right of the top bar of the **Palette "
"Editor**, and choose a display mode from the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"单击**调色板编辑器**顶部栏右侧的选项按钮（|options|），然后从打开的菜单中选择显"
"示模式。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:49
msgid ""
"Use the standard zoom **+** or **-** shortcut keys in the **Palette Editor** to "
"increase or decrease the styles chips size."
msgstr ""
"使用**调色板编辑器**中的标准缩放**+**或**-**快捷键来增加或减小样式芯片大小。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:52
msgid "**To make the Palette editor inactive or active:**"
msgstr "**要使调色板编辑器处于非活动或活动状态，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:54
msgid ""
"Click the **Switch** button (|switch|) on the right of the **Palette Editor** "
"title bar."
msgstr "单击**调色板编辑器**标题栏右侧的**切换**按钮（|切换|）。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:56
msgid "**To save a palette with a different name in a different location:**"
msgstr "**要将具有不同名称的调色板保存在不同位置，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:58
msgid ""
"Click the **Save Palette As** button (|save_as|) in the top bar of the "
"**Palette Editor**."
msgstr "单击**调色板编辑器**顶部栏中的**将调色板另存为**按钮（|Save_As|）。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:60
msgid ""
"In the browser that opens choose a location and name for the palette you want "
"to save, and click the **Save** button."
msgstr "在打开的浏览器中，为要保存的调色板选择位置和名称，然后单击**保存**按钮。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:62
msgid ""
"The **Save Palette As** command creates a copy of the palette with a different "
"file name and location, but does not change the name and location of the "
"palette used in the scene."
msgstr ""
"**将调色板另存为**命令使用不同的文件名和位置创建调色板的副本，但不会更改场景中使"
"用的调色板的名称和位置。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:68
msgid "Arranging Palette Styles and Pages"
msgstr "排列调色板样式和页面"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:69
msgid ""
"Palette styles can be added, named, reordered and arranged in pages. They can "
"be copied and pasted from one position to another, or from one palette to "
"another."
msgstr ""
"调色板样式可以在页面中添加、命名、重新排序和排列。它们可以从一个位置复制粘贴到另"
"一个位置，或者从一个调色板复制粘贴到其他调色板。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:71
msgid ""
"When styles used for painting drawings are **Cut**, lines and areas painted "
"with them will be displayed in **red**; if they are **Deleted**, you will be "
"prompted whether to delete the styles only and show the lines and areas painted "
"with them in red, or to delete the lines and areas painted with them as well."
msgstr ""
"当用于绘制图纸的样式为**剪切**时，用它们绘制的线条和区域将显示为**红色**；如果它"
"们是**已删除**，系统将提示您是仅删除样式并将用它们绘制的线条和区域显示为红色，还"
"是也删除用它们绘画的线条和面积。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:73
msgid "**To select a style:**"
msgstr "**要选择样式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:77
msgid "Click it in the **Palette Editor**."
msgstr "在**调色板编辑器**中单击它。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:79
msgid ""
"Use the number keys on the main or numerical keyboards to select the "
"corresponding style."
msgstr "使用主键盘或数字键盘上的数字键选择相应的样式。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:81
msgid ""
"When in **Medium/Large Thumbnails View** a visual cue of which key shortcut "
"corresponds to which style is shown on the upper center of each style chip."
msgstr ""
"在**中/大缩略图视图**中，每个样式芯片的上部中心显示了哪个快捷键对应哪个样式的视"
"觉提示。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:83
msgid ""
"In case of having more than 10 styles in the current palette, you can use the "
"**Tab key** on the keyboard to switch to the next bank of 10 styles."
msgstr ""
"如果当前调色板中有超过10种样式，您可以使用键盘上的**Tab键**切换到下一组10种样"
"式。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:85
msgid "**To select multiple styles:**"
msgstr "**选择多个样式:**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:89
msgid "Shift-click to extend the selection."
msgstr "按住Shift键并单击以扩展选择。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:91
msgid ""
"Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (Mac) to add a style to, or remove it from the "
"selection."
msgstr "Ctrl键单击（PC）或Cmd键单击（Mac）可将样式添加到选择中或从选择中删除。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:93
msgid "**To add a new style:**"
msgstr "**要添加新样式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:95
msgid ""
"Click the **New Style** button (|new_style|) in the top bar of the palette "
"editor."
msgstr "单击调色板编辑器顶部栏中的**新建样式**按钮（|New_Style|）。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:97
msgid "**To name a style:**"
msgstr "**要命名样式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:99
msgid ""
"When styles are displayed in **Medium/Large Thumbnails View** or **List View** "
"modes, double-click the style name to edit it."
msgstr ""
"当样式以**中/大缩略图视图**或**列表视图**模式显示时，双击样式名称进行编辑。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:101
msgid "**To edit palette styles with the Edit menu commands:**"
msgstr "**要使用“编辑”菜单命令编辑调色板样式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:103
msgid "Select the styles you want to edit."
msgstr "选择要编辑的样式。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:105
#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:316
msgid "Do any of the following:"
msgstr "执行以下任一操作："

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:107
msgid ""
"Use the **Cut** command to eliminate selected styles from the palette and keep "
"them in memory for further operations."
msgstr ""
"使用**剪切**命令从调色板中删除选定样式，并将其保留在内存中以供进一步操作。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:109
msgid ""
"Use the **Copy** command to keep in memory selected styles for further "
"operations."
msgstr "使用**复制**命令将选定样式保留在内存中以供进一步操作。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:111
msgid ""
"Use the **Paste Insert** command to paste styles kept in memory in the palette, "
"after the currently selected style. **Cut** styles will be added preserving "
"their indexes; **Copied** styles will be added using new indexes."
msgstr ""
"使用**粘贴插入**命令将保存在调色板内存中的样式粘贴到当前选定的样式之后。**将添加"
"剪切**样式，保留其索引；**复制的**样式将使用新索引添加。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:113
msgid ""
"Use the **Paste Color & Name** command to paste styles kept in memory, over the "
"styles selected in the palette, overwriting their content. If the selection "
"contains less styles than those kept in memory, styles in excess will be "
"ignored; if the selection contains more styles than those kept in memory, "
"styles in excess will be left as they are."
msgstr ""
"使用**粘贴颜色和名称**命令将保存在内存中的样式粘贴到调色板中选定的样式上，覆盖其"
"内容。如果所选内容包含的样式少于内存中保存的样式，则多余的样式将被忽略；如果所选"
"内容包含的样式比内存中保存的样式多，则多余的样式将保持原样。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:115
msgid ""
"Use the **Paste Color** command to paste the red, green, blue and alpha values "
"of the styles kept in memory in the styles selected in the palette, preserving "
"their name. If the selection contains less styles than those kept in memory, "
"styles in excess will be ignored; if the selection contains more styles than "
"those kept in memory, styles in excess will be left as they are."
msgstr ""
"使用**粘贴颜色**命令将内存中保存的样式的红色、绿色、蓝色和阿尔法值粘贴到调色板中"
"选定的样式中，并保留其名称。如果所选内容包含的样式少于内存中保存的样式，则多余的"
"样式将被忽略；如果所选内容包含的样式比内存中保存的样式多，则多余的样式将保持原"
"样。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:117
msgid ""
"Use the **Paste Name** command to paste the names of the styles kept in memory "
"in the styles selected in the palette, preserving their colors. If the "
"selection contains less styles than those kept in memory, styles in excess will "
"be ignored; if the selection contains more styles than those kept in memory, "
"styles in excess will be left as they are."
msgstr ""
"使用**粘贴名称**命令将内存中保存的样式名称粘贴到调色板中选定的样式中，并保留其颜"
"色。如果所选内容包含的样式少于内存中保存的样式，则多余的样式将被忽略；如果所选内"
"容包含的样式比内存中保存的样式多，则多余的样式将保持原样。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:119
msgid "Use the **Delete** command to delete selected styles."
msgstr "使用**删除**命令删除选定样式。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:121
msgid ""
"All the **Edit** menu commands are also available in the menu that opens when "
"right-clicking the selection."
msgstr "所有**编辑**菜单命令也可在右键单击选择时打开的菜单中使用。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:123
msgid "**To move selected styles:**"
msgstr "**要移动选定样式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:125
msgid ""
"Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (Mac) and drag the selection to the new position; "
"the insertion point is marked while you drag."
msgstr ""
"Ctrl键单击（PC）或Cmd键单击（Mac）并将所选内容拖动到新位置；拖动时会标记插入点。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:127
msgid "**To move selected styles into a different page:**"
msgstr "**要将所选样式移动到其他页面，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:129
msgid ""
"Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (Mac) and drag the selection to the tab of the "
"page where you want to put selected styles."
msgstr ""
"按住Ctrl键单击（PC）或按住Cmd键单击（Mac），然后将所选内容拖动到要放置所选样式的"
"页面选项卡上。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:131
msgid "**To move styles into a new page:**"
msgstr "**要将样式移动到新页面中，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:133
msgid ""
"Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (Mac) and drag the selection to the right of the "
"last page tab: a new page will be created containing the dragged styles."
msgstr ""
"按住Ctrl键单击（PC）或Cmd键单击（Mac），然后将所选内容拖动到最后一个页面选项卡的"
"右侧：将创建一个包含拖动样式的新页面。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:135
msgid "**To remove all the unused styles:**"
msgstr "**要删除所有未使用的样式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:137
msgid ""
"Right-click in the palette and choose **Remove Unused Styles** from the menu "
"that opens."
msgstr "在调色板中单击鼠标右键，然后从打开的菜单中选择**删除未使用的样式**。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:139
msgid "**To add a new page:**"
msgstr "**要添加新页面，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:143
msgid ""
"Click the **New Page** button (|new_page|) in the top bar of the Palette Editor."
msgstr "单击调色板编辑器顶部栏中的**新建页面**按钮（|New_Page|）。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:145
msgid ""
"Right-click in the palette area where page tabs are displayed and choose **New "
"Page** from the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"在显示页面选项卡的调色板区域中单击鼠标右键，然后从打开的菜单中选择**新建页面**。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:147
msgid "**To name a page:**"
msgstr "**要命名页面，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:149
msgid "Double-click the page name to edit it."
msgstr "双击页面名称进行编辑。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:151
msgid "**To move a page:**"
msgstr "**要移动页面，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:153
msgid "Click and drag the page tab to the new position."
msgstr "单击页面选项卡并将其拖动到新位置。"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:155
msgid "**To delete a page:**"
msgstr "**要删除页面，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_palettes_and_styles.rst:157
